    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT301 · Assessment 3/6</span>\n<h2>Individual Presentation of Milestones</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 12387 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT301 · Đầu điểm 3/6</span>\n<h2>Individual Presentation of Milestones</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 12387 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Max: 10' each group<br><br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Individual Presentation<br><br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Presentation in class.<br><br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">4 Milestones of the project<br><br>1 member of the group will be assigned to present each milestone. There might be two students if the group has more than 4 members.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Class room presentation</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Each member of the group will be assign to present with 1 specific part of the 4 milestones.<br><br>The purpose of the milestone presentations is to check the progress of the project.<br><br>Based on the content of the milestone presentation, feedback will be given to the whole group on the project so that they can improve their performance in the final presentation<br><br>The assessment will be conducted individually and individual marks are given to the presenters base on the students' performance during their presentation and their overall understanding, contribution of the group project</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 55 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Session 56 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Session 57 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Session 58 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Session 59 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Session 60 — Project Final Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 55 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 56 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 57 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 58 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 59 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 60 — Project Final Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=MKT301\">Exam Room — MKT301</a> (3 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=MKT301\">Phòng thi — MKT301</a> (3 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
