    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT301 · Assessment 4/6</span>\n<h2>Project Final Presentation and Report</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 12387 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT301 · Đầu điểm 4/6</span>\n<h2>Project Final Presentation and Report</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 12387 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: 20 mins presentation<br><br>&amp; 3000 word report<br><br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Group presentation with the evaluation from the industry and the lecturer (15%)<br><br>The final written report (15%)<br><br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Presentation: max 20 mins<br><br>Group written report: up to 3000 words</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Group presentation in class room<br><br>and Final report submitted on the last slot</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">The presentation (15%) will be evaluated either by the business and the Lecturer. The mark is given based on both the depth and width of the goal achievement of the research project, the feasibility of the recommendations and the presentation skills. The language of this presentation might be either in Vietnamese or in English as it is easier for the industry to evaluate.<br><br>The written report (10%) is marked by the instructor based on the research project, the feasibility of the recommendations and the overall presentation of the report . A copy of this written report will be sent to the business also. The language for this report must be in English</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 13 — Project Milestone1: Research Proposal, Secondary Data and Literature review</li><li>Session 14 — Project Milestone1: Research Proposal, Secondary Data and Literature review</li><li>Session 55 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Session 56 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Session 57 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Session 58 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Session 59 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Session 60 — Project Final Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 13 — Project Milestone1: Research Proposal, Secondary Data and Literature review</li><li>Buổi 14 — Project Milestone1: Research Proposal, Secondary Data and Literature review</li><li>Buổi 55 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 56 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 57 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 58 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 59 — Project Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 60 — Project Final Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=MKT301\">Exam Room — MKT301</a> (3 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=MKT301\">Phòng thi — MKT301</a> (3 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
